@startuml Sequence Diagram - Doctors-Service (Schedule Appointment)
actor Admin
participant AppointmentController
participant ClientsServiceClient
participant PhysicianRepository
participant AppointmentRepository

Admin -> AppointmentController: POST /appointments/admin (AdminAppointmentRequest)
AppointmentController -> ClientsServiceClient: getPatientById(patientId)
ClientsServiceClient -> ClientsServiceClient: webClient.get() to clients-service
ClientsServiceClient --> AppointmentController: PatientClientResponse
AppointmentController -> PhysicianRepository: findById(physicianId)
PhysicianRepository --> AppointmentController: Physician
AppointmentController -> AppointmentRepository: existsByPhysicianAndDateTime(physician, dateTime)
AppointmentRepository --> AppointmentController: false
AppointmentController -> Appointment: new Appointment(dateTime, reason, ...)
AppointmentController -> AppointmentRepository: save(appointment)
AppointmentRepository --> AppointmentController: appointment saved
AppointmentController --> Admin: ResponseEntity.ok(AppointmentResponse)
@enduml
